   "title": "Moomins and music",
   "text": [
    "Tove Jansson created the Moomins in 1945. Jean Sibelius's Finlandia became a symbol of the nation, and architect Alvar Aalto shaped modern design. Finland has more heavy metal bands per person than almost anywhere, and the monster-costumed band Lordi won Eurovision in 2006."
